  "description": "TASK 2 POC — 2-machine Canvas proof-of-concept for the future 10-machine Factory Digital Twin. Proves the Canvas mechanism (rectangle/text/metric-value/icon elements, field-bound colors driven by fieldConfig.defaults overrides with mappings, and drill-down links) works end-to-end against real data before scaling to the full 10-machine / 5-zone build. Fixed node positions (not a templated repeat) — each node's query target is hardcoded to one literal eqp_id, same pattern the full plan's Task 4/5 design will use. Machines shown: LDI-01 (real state OK at build time) and LDI-02 (real state ALARM at build time, real Major alarm within the last 5 minutes) — picked because they were genuinely different live states, not simulated. State classification (0=NO_DATA, 1=IDLE, 2=OK, 3=ALARM) copied verbatim from ims-ldi-operator-andon.json panel id 1000's CASE logic.",
